SCCM 25H2 Content Status Troubleshooting

CAS reports Downloaded = Yes | Primary Site reports Downloaded = No
Investigation guide and remediation decision plan  •  9 November 2026
1. Incident summary
Windows 11 25H2 feature update content appears to be downloaded and deployment initiated from the Central Administration Site (CAS) is working. On the affected Primary Site, the update displays Downloaded = No, and deployments initiated there fail. The issue persisted after a Configuration Manager site upgrade. The team initially suspected metadata but has not confirmed the root cause.
